& {[(5-5 \lambda) \mathbf{i}+(5-5 \lambda) \mathbf{j}] \cdot[5 \lambda \mathbf{i}+(5 \lambda-1) \mathbf{j}+2 \mathbf{k}] }=0 \\
&(5-5 \lambda)(5 \lambda)+(5-5 \lambda)(5 \lambda-1)=0 \\
&-5(\lambda-1)(10 \lambda-1)=0 \\
& \lambda=\frac{1}{10} \quad \text { or } \quad \lambda=1 \quad \text { 或 } \quad \text { (rejected) }
\end{aligned}
$$
Since $C$ is the mid－point of $A D$ ，we have
由於 $C$ 為 $A D$ 的中點，可得
$$
\begin{gathered}
\overrightarrow{A D}=2 \overrightarrow{A C}=-\mathbf{i}+\mathbf{j}-4 \mathbf{k} \\
\overrightarrow{O D}=\overrightarrow{A D}-\overrightarrow{A O}=4 \mathbf{i}+5 \mathbf{j}-2 \mathbf{k}
\end{gathered}
$$
